Parts of quadruped class and their responsibility
Quadruped: Holds all information as one big class
    Legs: Responsible for storing current pose/targs of leg, as well as calculating its
    own IK
        CycloidTrajectory3D: EACH LEG SHOULD HAVE ITS OWN CYCLOID TRAJECTORY UNDER ITSELF. HELLO?
    Gait Planner: The gait planner needs to interact with all legs, therefore it should be under the
    quadruped. But can't it be an actual PART of the quadruped class instead of avoid having to alias
    the jorts off of my code? It would also put the motion vectors directly under the quadruped
    which is much more desirable, right???
IK: Standalone non-instantiable IK class meant to just have the function to calc IK. This
code doesn't need to be copied 4 times in memory on each leg, that would be kinda pointless

